fac: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
fac: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://ontology.example.com/factory/1.0.0> .
fac: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阀门工厂本体" .
fac:BusinessObject <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
fac:BusinessObject <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "BusinessObject" .
fac:Valve_products <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
fac:Valve_products <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "产品" .
fac:Valve_products <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "工厂对外销售/交付的成品阀门及其派生型号, 含口径、压力等级、连接方式、密封与阀体材质等规格。" .
fac:Valve_products <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> fac:BusinessObject .
fac:Valve_customers <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
fac:Valve_customers <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "客户" .
fac:Valve_customers <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "采购阀门产品的客户企业, 记录区域、行业归属与信用等级。" .
fac:Valve_customers <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> fac:BusinessObject .
fac:Valve_sales <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
fac:Valve_sales <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "销售" .
fac:Valve_sales <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "一次阀门销售记录, 关联产品与客户, 含数量、日期与金额。" .
fac:Valve_sales <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> fac:BusinessObject .
fac:Valve_equipment <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
fac:Valve_equipment <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "设备" .
fac:Valve_equipment <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "生产现场的设备台账, 含设备类型、所属车间、装机功率与运行状态。" .
fac:Valve_equipment <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> fac:BusinessObject .
fac:Valve_raw_materials <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
fac:Valve_raw_materials <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "原材料" .
fac:Valve_raw_materials <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "采购入库的原材料/零部件, 含材质、供应商与到货质检结果。" .
fac:Valve_raw_materials <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> fac:BusinessObject .
fac:Valve_batches <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
fac:Valve_batches <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "批次" .
fac:Valve_batches <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "一次生产批次, 关联生产的产品、用料、班组与批状态。" .
fac:Valve_batches <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> fac:BusinessObject .
fac:Valve_batch_ingredient <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
fac:Valve_batch_ingredient <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "批次原料" .
fac:Valve_batch_ingredient <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "批次与原材料的多对多配料明细(批次用料构成)。" .
fac:Valve_batch_ingredient <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> fac:BusinessObject .
fac:Valve_qc <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
fac:Valve_qc <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "质检" .
fac:Valve_qc <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "批次的质量检验记录, 含检查项目、压力规则、保压时长与泄漏判定结果。" .
fac:Valve_qc <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> fac:BusinessObject .
